WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.130
Eleven mentions.

00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.030
Three different first choices.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.550
In Recoscope’s November 15
space heater benchmark,

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:09.990
Dreo appeared in 11 of 12
usable answers.

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:11.850
But in the comparative prompt,

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.370
Claude and Gemini ranked Dreo first.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.090
ChatGPT ranked Vornado first.

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.510
Perplexity ranked De’Longhi first.

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:22.230
The snapshot covers four AI assistants

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.710
and three prompt types:

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.850
discovery, under $100, and ranking.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:30.270
Dreo also appeared in
all four budget answers.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.550
That doesn’t verify an
under-$100 checkout price.

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:36.770
Different models and heating types
appeared across the answers.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:39.870
These findings describe
captured AI responses,

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.410
not product quality or safety ratings.

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:45.610
Track how often a brand appears,
and where it ranks.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.530
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
